<title>BELGIUM: EU set to open 97/98 sugar export tenders August 6.</title>
<headline>EU set to open 97/98 sugar export tenders August 6.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union expects to open 1997/98 (July/June) white sugar export tenders on August 6, European Commission officials said.</p>
<p>They added that the final 1996/97 tender would be on July 30.</p>
<p>The EU has for the past two seasons launched new export tenders in August, one month later than usual, reflecting a slower flow of exports.</p>
<p>--Brussels newsroom +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
